title: Rent, Mortgages and the Missing Homes
subtitle: A housing coalition is broad until somebody asks who must lose money.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_housing_households_timer <= 0 and (household_security < 75 or early_election_risk >= 30)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_housing_households_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/housing-households.webp

= Rent, Mortgages and the Missing Homes

Tenant groups demand security, municipalities demand financing and indebted
households fear every interest-rate headline. Developers and banks call any
intervention an attack on supply. The alliance must decide whom its housing
policy is designed to disappoint.

- @tenant_plan
- @municipal_compact
- @balanced_message

@tenant_plan
title: Publish a tenant-first housing plan
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Razem gains a flagship; liberals see an interventionist threat.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Drafting enforcement and tenant-support institutions costs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; household_policy_pressure += 4; razem_cooperation += 5; razem_dissent -= 4; labor_credibility += 2; feminist_trust += 1; budget_promises += 1; ko_relation -= 3; young_support += 3; urban_progressive_support += 3; women_support += 1; primary_tenant_slate = 1; primary_social_slate = 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Party programme"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Tenant security becomes a Left coalition test"

Longer notice, enforceable standards and public legal support turn housing from
a construction target into a question of power. Razem finally has a flagship it
can defend without qualification.

- #poland_card_finish

@municipal_compact
title: Finance a municipal housing compact
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Broad local support and a large budget obligation.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Municipal design teams and financing work cost two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; household_policy_pressure += 6; local_network += 3; psl_relation += 3; public_trust += 1; health_policy_pressure += 1; budget_promises += 3; rural_support += 2; public_sector_support += 2; pensioner_support += 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Party and municipal advocacy"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Municipalities join a public-housing compact"

Cities and smaller towns receive a common financing model while retaining local
delivery. PSL likes the municipal power. Razem likes the public stock. The
treasurer circles the total in red.

- #poland_card_finish

@balanced_message
title: Balance tenants, mortgage holders and private supply
subtitle: Free, popular language that avoids deciding where the losses fall.
on-arrival: household_policy_pressure += 2; public_trust += 1; ko_relation += 3; barons_dissent -= 1; razem_dissent += 5; labor_credibility -= 2; party_unity += 1; rural_support += 1; pensioner_support += 1; tactical_desertion_to_ko += 0.8; tactical_desertion_to_p2050 += 0.6; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Party programme"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The housing plan promises security without naming a loser"

Every household hears its anxiety acknowledged, and no powerful institution is
challenged directly. The plan polls well. Tenant organisers call it a brochure
for the status quo.

- #poland_card_finish
